# A call the recogniser finishes before the rest of the sentence ("Hey
# Veda." ... "What time is it?", as Deepgram does when the speaker pauses
# after the name): the agent wakes once the sentence is over, and all of it
# is the first thing said in the conversation.
agent-asleep
fail-on "PANIC"
wait-serial "desktop ready" 120
mic-silence 3
wait-serial "listening for its name" 30
mic-silence 3
mic-tone 1.5
wait-serial "someone is speaking" 20
agent-hear "Hey Veda. | What time is it?" 30
wait-serial "woken by its name" 20
agent-connected 60
agent-expect "Hey Veda. What time is it?" 20
agent-expect InjectUserMessage 5
agent-listens 1
